{"seq":47,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"marked","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f07496"},"reason":"Body sentence rewritten; span moved onto the Minecraft of the new 'This is why some lists…' sentence.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_best-selling_video_games"}],"changes":[{"field":"spans","old":{"en":[2259,9],"de":[2524,9],"ru":[2327,9]},"new":{"en":[2378,9],"de":[2640,9],"ru":[2450,9]}}],"hash":"9fed5a073769","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"e17fd9778a291a0f28c1740b20dfd2dc57fac90dff31faedff8347ba7139b9fc"},
{"seq":48,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w07496"},"reason":"'In 2019 the best-selling game after Tetris' is contested (Wikipedia and others call Minecraft the best-selling game from May 2019 on); narrowed to the verifiable 176 million copies by 2019, second only to Tetris on lists that count all Tetris versions. Card text kept in cardText.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.pcgamer.com/minecraft-has-sold-176-million-copies-may-be-the-best-selling-game-ever/"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minecraft"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which open-world game by the Swedish programmer Markus „Notch“ Persson is, in 2019, the best-selling video game in the world after Tetris?","new":"Which open-world game by the Swedish programmer Markus „Notch“ Persson had sold 176 million copies by 2019 – second only to Tetris on lists that count all of Tetris's versions together?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welches Open-World-Spiel des schwedischen Programmierers Markus „Notch“ Persson ist 2019 das nach Tetris am häufigsten verkaufte Videospiel der Welt?","new":"Welches Open-World-Spiel des schwedischen Programmierers Markus „Notch“ Persson hatte bis 2019 176 Millionen Exemplare verkauft – nur von Tetris übertroffen, wenn man alle Tetris-Versionen zusammenzählt?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какая игра с открытым миром шведского программиста Маркуса «Notch» Перссона в 2019 году была самой продаваемой видеоигрой в мире после «Тетриса»?","new":"Какая игра с открытым миром шведского программиста Маркуса «Notch» Перссона к 2019 году разошлась тиражом 176 миллионов копий – уступая лишь «Тетрису», если сложить все его версии?"},{"field":"cardText","new":"Welches Open-World-Spiel des schwedischen Programmierers Markus „Notch“ Persson ist 2019 das nach Tetris am häufigsten verkaufte Videospiel der Welt?"}],"hash":"e0e50e06615c","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"52b7f17ad